    "terrainName": "basic-desert",
    "description": "What: a destroyed tank catches fire and the fire burns a man beside it (CE-4660, thermal drivers TD-16 / TD-6; docs/designs/thermal/DESIGN_Thermal_Drivers.md \u00a74g). On basic-desert one friendly M1 ('Tank', BasicVehicleSop) faces an idle enemy T-72 ('Enemy Tank', 240 m north). 'Bystander', a neutral man holding, stands 3 m beside the T-72 \u2014 inside the fire's reach (the hull's half-length + 1.5 m); 'Onlooker', another neutral man holding, stands 40 m east of it. The M1 kills the T-72 with a kinetic round (no blast). Judge: the T-72's Health owner lights its wreck (FireState, one spot burning its type's 30 min \u2014 sim state, the same on every node and for a late joiner); the Bystander loses 10 % of his health per whole second and dies in the fire; the Onlooker loses nothing; the M1 survives. Fail: the wreck does not burn, the Bystander is unhurt, or the Onlooker burns."
  },
